OL,3,GNEWSAJudge engaged in sexualised
OL,4,Abehaviour with staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge inappropriately touched a
OL,7,Fjunior staff member and subjected women
OL,8,Fto "sexualised behaviour," an
OL,9,Finvestigation found.
OL,11,FEmployment judge Christopher Gaskell's
OL,12,Fbehaviour was an abuse of his position
OL,13,Fand caused distress to staff, the
OL,14,Freport continued.
